OL,3,AApple unveils its first folding iPhone
OL,4,
OL,5,FApple has revealed its first folding
OL,6,FiPhone with a starting price of $2,000
OL,7,F(#1,475).
OL,9,FThe new phone, dubbed the Duo, is now
OL,10,Fone of the most expensive smartphones
OL,11,Fon the market. The model with the
OL,12,Fbiggest storage option goes up to
OL,13,F$3,200 (#2,360).
OL,15,FChief executive John Ternus said the
OL,16,FDuo, which has a book-style format, was
OL,17,F"inspired by the iPad" and called the
OL,18,Ffolding features "fluid and completely
OL,19,Fintuitive".
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
