OL,3,AApple unveils its first folding iPhone
OL,4,
OL,5,FBut critics say the phone risks
OL,6,Fbecoming a "premium-priced ornament"
OL,7,Fthat doesn't bring meaningful growth to
OL,8,Fthe firm, which pundits say hasn't
OL,9,Frevealed seriously stand-out features
OL,10,Fin many years.
